The household survey conducted in all regions of Uzbekistan. The survey is based on the principles of voluntary participation in the selected households. Households that fall into the selection, are examined within a month, after which they are replacing (the rotation). The survey is based on direct survey (interviews) of household members and maintaining the household diary. 

In the survey reference period of a single household provides the following questionnaire completion documents: 
1. Questionnaire to interview the household;
2. Diary account of daily expenses (goods and services are encoded by the Classifier of Individual Consumption by Purpose);
3. Questionnaire for the final interview;
4. Questionnaire for individual interviews.

